\item[S2] Raman Sanyal, Axel Werner and Günter M. Ziegler, \emph{On Kalai's conjectures concerning centrally symmetric polytopes} (2007), arXiv:0708.3661v2, Section 1, Conjecture A. \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/0708.3661v2}.
